# Generated project (xcodegen)
# Lode.xcodeproj is generated from project.yml; regenerate with `xcodegen generate`.
# The committed project definition is the new-format project.xcproj; the legacy
# pbxproj produced by xcodegen (e.g. for CI on older Xcode) is generated, not tracked.
Lode.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj

